{"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/SE","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/SQ","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/s8SendableP"],"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/OpaqueEnrollment\/init(opaque_session:registration_record:)"],"title":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/OpaqueEnrollment\/opaque_session","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/OpaqueEnrollment\/registration_record"],"title":"Instance Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/OpaqueEnrollment\/Equatable-Implementations"],"generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations"}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK16OpaqueEnrollmentV","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OpaqueEnrollment","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"title":"OpaqueEnrollment","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OpaqueEnrollment","kind":"identifier"}]},"abstract":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"opaque","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" object CONTRACT.md §23 defines: a registration record and the server-issued","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"session handle that identifies the exchange it came from.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/opaqueenrollment"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/OpaqueEnrollment","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OpaqueEnrollment","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"headi